3ebcec1b (2150 1792690335363 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing readme") (src . "README: the 1.3.0 gaps filled and the old refusals updated\n\nSeventeen gaps between the README and the tree at 0263978 closed, five old\nrefusal descriptions brought up to the answers the verbs give, and the query\nand rule language chapter rewritten construct by construct (the language's\nname, Manteia, used once and consistently). Also: the export verbs' known\nlimit restated as \"a past cut has no working export\" (--cut is refused only\nwith --working or --writer), the review channel's frozen-candidate exception\n(a changed candidate copy is a proposal in review-results and becomes a draft\nonly through collect-into --to-writer), the context verb's introduction\ncorrected to the daemon's query session kept across requests, and\nedit-export's git-failed / bad-base refusals described as the tool decides\nthem. Documentation only: the fixtures that read the README (21) pass on\nthis text over 0263978 with the baseline row counts.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 451))))
